# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) and fill in. Vite loads it in dev, build and preview.
#
# VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN: a public Mapbox access token (pk.…) for the map and the names of
# clicked points; leave empty to see the message that replaces the map (search and location still work).
# It is inlined into this remote's bundle: use a URL-restricted public token.
# This remote's own value is used, also when the shell hosts it.
VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN=
